From c2048a7ec9c7cb2fe9359da230466ca9a668a4eb Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: root <root@ryzen7950x0.servers.moe>
Date: Wed, 30 Sep 2026 11:20:39 -0700
Subject: [PATCH] server: --multidecode and POST /v1/multidecode (0131)

Forest one-shot and multi-step sticky sessions via parent_node_ids.
---
 common/arg.cpp                  |   7 ++
 common/common.h                 |   1 +
 tools/server/server-context.cpp | 188 ++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++
 tools/server/server-context.h   |   1 +
 tools/server/server.cpp         |   3 +
 5 files changed, 200 insertions(+)

